EUROCONTROL Aviation Intelligence Unit — Data Licence
======================================================

The following files in this directory are published by EUROCONTROL's
Aviation Intelligence Unit (https://ansperformance.eu) and are reused here
under its terms, not under this project's own code licence:

- atfm_slot_adherence_2025.csv, atfm_slot_adherence_2026.csv
- apt_dly_2025.csv.bz2, apt_dly_2026.csv.bz2
- airport_traffic_2025.csv, airport_traffic_2026.csv

Terms (per the publisher): free to copy and redistribute with attribution;
non-commercial use only.

This licence applies only to the data files listed above (and any table
derived from them), not to this project's own source code, which is
covered separately under the GPLv3 terms required by the challenge rules
(see CLAUDE.md). Keeping the two licences in separate files makes clear
that the non-commercial restriction attaches to this data, not to the code
that reads it.

Attribution: "Contains data from EUROCONTROL's Aviation Intelligence Unit"
(https://ansperformance.eu).

Use of this data for the PRC 2026 Data Challenge was confirmed permitted by
challenge admins via Discord ruling, 2026-09-17.
